{
  "items": [
    {
      "i": 0,
      "text": "The new Discover Weekly algorithm is actually getting better. It found three obscure indie bands I now love. The app is stable and the audio quality on my headphones is crisp. No complaints."
    },
    {
      "i": 1,
      "text": "Good service overall, but the price hike last year was a bit of a shock. I still use it daily for work playlists, so I'm sticking around, but I'm keeping an eye on Apple Music's bundle deals."
    },
    {
      "i": 2,
      "text": "Why did you remove the ability to sort playlists by date added? It's a basic feature that used to be there. Now I have to manually search for songs I added last week. Very frustrating UI change."
    },
    {
      "i": 3,
      "text": "Terrible. My subscription got charged twice this month and customer support has been ignoring my tickets for two weeks. I'm cancelling immediately. Worst experience I've had with a streaming service."
    },
    {
      "i": 4,
      "text": "The app crashes every time I try to switch to offline mode in the car. Bluetooth connection drops constantly. I'm switching to Tidal because at least their app doesn't freeze on me."
    },
    {
      "i": 5,
      "text": "Absolutely love the podcast integration. I listen to 5+ hours of audio content weekly. The seamless transition between music and podcasts is a game changer. Worth every penny."
    },
    {
      "i": 6,
      "text": "Great catalog and the family plan is a steal for our household. My kids have their own profiles and I can control what they hear. The parental controls are easy to set up and work well."
    },
    {
      "i": 7,
      "text": "Best music app on the market. The lyrics feature is super helpful for learning new songs, and the shuffle mode actually feels random now. I recommend it to everyone I know."
    },
    {
      "i": 8,
      "text": "I can't believe they still don't have a proper desktop app for Linux. I have to use the web player which is clunky and lacks features. If you want to be a serious competitor, fix this."
    },
    {
      "i": 9,
      "text": "The student discount is a lifesaver. I've been using it for three years and the music selection is vast. The app is smooth on my phone and the offline downloads work perfectly for my commute."
    },
    {
      "i": 10,
      "text": "It's fine. I use it mostly for specific albums I own. The recommendations are okay, but I don't really use the daily mixes. I might switch to a cheaper service if the price goes up again."
    },
    {
      "i": 11,
      "text": "Love the new UI. It's cleaner and faster. The ability to edit playlist covers is a nice touch. I've been a subscriber for 5 years and it keeps getting better. Highly recommend."
    },
    {
      "i": 12,
      "text": "I like the music, but the ads on the free tier are too intrusive. I tried the premium trial but the price is too high for me right now. I'll stick to the free version for now."
    },
    {
      "i": 13,
      "text": "Perfect. The audio quality is top-notch, the app is stable, and the catalog is huge. I listen to everything from classical to hip-hop. No other service comes close to this level of convenience."
    },
    {
      "i": 14,
      "text": "My account got locked out for no reason and I can't get it back. Support said to wait 48 hours, but it's been 3 days. I'm losing access to my entire library. This is unacceptable."
    },
    {
      "i": 15,
      "text": "Solid service. The only thing I miss is the old interface, but I'm getting used to the new one. The music selection is great and the app works well on my tablet. Would recommend to friends."
    },
    {
      "i": 16,
      "text": "The collaborative playlists are a great feature. I share a playlist with my partner and we both add songs. It's a fun way to discover new music together. The app is reliable and fast."
    },
    {
      "i": 17,
      "text": "Excellent. The integration with my smart home devices is seamless. I can control music from my phone, tablet, or voice assistant. The audio quality is consistent across all devices. 10/10."
    },
    {
      "i": 18,
      "text": "I appreciate the effort to improve the recommendation engine. It's getting smarter about my taste. The app is stable and the offline mode is reliable. I'm happy with my subscription."
    },
    {
      "i": 19,
      "text": "Great for discovering new artists. The 'Release Radar' playlist is always spot on. I've found several new favorite bands through it. The app is easy to use and the audio quality is good."
    },
    {
      "i": 20,
      "text": "Best in class. The catalog is unmatched, the app is smooth, and the features are constantly improving. I've tried other services but nothing compares to Spotify's ecosystem. Highly recommended."
    },
    {
      "i": 21,
      "text": "Love it. The family plan is great value, and the kids' profiles are well-designed. The music selection is vast, and the app is stable. I recommend it to anyone looking for a streaming service."
    },
    {
      "i": 22,
      "text": "It's okay. I use it for background music while working. The recommendations are decent, but I don't really engage with the app much. I might cancel if the price increases again."
    },
    {
      "i": 23,
      "text": "The new features are great. The ability to download podcasts for offline listening is a huge plus. The app is stable and the audio quality is excellent. I'm very satisfied with my subscription."
    },
    {
      "i": 24,
      "text": "Perfect. The app is fast, the catalog is huge, and the recommendations are spot on. I use it daily for music and podcasts. The audio quality is top-notch. I recommend it to everyone."
    }
  ]
}
